    "physical_description": "Kain (skirt cloth) of silk, single ikat (<i>kain limar</i>). Dark red ground, with weft ikat design suggesting a trellis (but not joined where the intersections would occur) enclosing stylised rosettes, etc. Designs in white, yellow, orange, magenta. Head section divided into bands, broad and narrow, of similar designs on a softer red ground, in orange, blue, green, white and black.",
